meta {
  name: Visitor audio call
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/call
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "tenantId": "self",
    "sessionId": "sess-demo-1",
    "visitorSecret": "REPLACE_WITH_REGISTERED_VISITOR_CAPABILITY",
    "action": "status"
  }
}

docs {
  Actions: status, invite, accept, decline, cancel, end, grant. Include id for
  transitions/grant and the private nonce for visitor transitions. invite is
  allowed only when tenant callSettings enables visitor requests and the handoff
  trigger qualifies. The visitorSecret is registered by the chat flow.
  Cross-origin widget responses, including coordinator-owned grants, return the
  configured Access-Control-Allow-Origin header. Accepting in the widget begins
  connecting without a second Join action.
}
